<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 195 mln rand S.African bonds Wed.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 195 mln rand S.African bonds Wed.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net sellers of 195.42 million rand's worth of South African bonds on Wednesday after selling 480.54 million rand on Tuesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
